  "body": "Modern comfort. Easy-care living. More time for you.\r\n\r\nJust two years old, this Fletcher-built home pairs contemporary style with everyday practicality, with a master build guarantee adding confidence to your next move.\r\n\r\nGenerous 2.7m ceilings, natural light and beautifully finished interiors give everyday living a little extra lift. Relaxed evenings, friends around the table and weekends exploring the coast, this is a home that leaves more room for the things you enjoy. Our vendors have purchased elsewhere and this modern, stress free home is ready for its next chapter.\r\n\r\nDEADLINE: Closing 4pm, Tuesday 1st December 2026 (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nFEATURES YOU'LL LOVE:\r\n* Two years old, built by Fletchers\r\n* Balance of 10 year Master Build Guarantee remaining\r\n* Three bedrooms, master with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n* Two bathrooms plus a guest powder room\r\n* Impressive 2.7m stud height\r\n* Light-filled open-plan living and dining\r\n* Contemporary kitchen with quality finishes\r\n* Ducted heating and cooling\r\n* Double glazing and heat pump\r\n* Separate laundry\r\n* Internal-access garage\r\n* Fully fenced backyard for the kids and pets\r\n\r\nEnjoy the Red Beach lifestyle, with local shops and everyday essentials close by, plus Silverdale Shopping Centre and Orewa's cafés and coastline a short drive away. Zoned for Red Beach School and Whangaparaoa College, with Stella Maris Primary and Kingsway School nearby.\r\n\r\nWelcome home.\r\n\r\n*Some images have been virtually staged for marketing purposes only.",
